          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Kanuka imugatin lukaitodikin, ka ainakinet naka akiria natir, ka ainakinet naicweio natir, nuka asabaton, ka napilamununia elap, ka ipuein lueseunitai, ka nuka iboro lukalaunak, ka ainakineta nuka adiakaret aitulucio Isirael, ido kaswam kere naka etogo loka Edekewok. ",
          "type": "text",
