        {
          "text": " Kipou kelamilamata eroet, isasedotin, ka Ilebin, ka ituŋa, kanuka ainakinet naka akito, ayaunun toma togo loka Edekewok, kwape ejaatar ikekia luka lukapapaawok, kapakio nueseunitai kaŋolikaru, aieweenena kotem loka EJAKAIT Edekewok, kwape kiwadikatere kokisila: ",
          "type": "text",
