        {
          "text": " Ido ikiyaik luka odwewok, ka luka ibarenewok, kwape kiwadikatere kokisila: ka ikiyaik luka isipanin luka aituk ka amerekekin, ayaunun toma togo loka Edekewok, mama ejaas isasedotin luiiaanakinete togo loka Edekewok. ",
