        },
        {
          "text": " Ayaunun da nugeet nuka ainumaretawok, ka ainakinetawok nukikianara, ka araito nuka iponesio kere luka ikito, ebino ka akinyet, mama ejaas isasedotin, kotoma agolai nukotogo loka Edekewok; ka idiopet kotomoneta luka alupowok mama ejaas Ilebin; naarai ŋul, kes Ilebin, luetukonokinete idiopet kotomoneta koreriawok kere luekoriere. ",
